","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"表層はパン粉とオリーブオイルです。","ts":"1633057468.340600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"r=Sqm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"66e6a713-b4f2-4e9a-89a8-265f67362c7a","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"普通のカレーライスよりも濃厚な作りに。","ts":"1633057441.340100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/0N"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c58ad561-4cb0-4fd6-b862-5eb5da074df4","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"カレーは両方です! 野菜を炒めるときに先に粉した上で、その後stockとルーを入れる的な","ts":"1633057436.339900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U843L486L"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vdFD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"FC69082D-D77C-4FF5-BD18-E2F17535650C","type":"message","user":"U843L486L","text":"二層構造で焦げもついてておいしそうですね。カレーはルーがしっかりした感じというところでしょうか。それとも粉で風味づけかな。","ts":"1633057363.339100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":1,"users":["U03C4RC8X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"w=Y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ab494722-65ac-4fa3-bfb6-67975a520712","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"(どんこ、アクセントとしてあえて1個にするというの、技巧派だ・・・!)","ts":"1633057300.337300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tUIiH"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"先日、焼きカレーを作りました。浅草橋のSTONEを意識してます。底に天然酵母パンでつくったクルトンを敷きました","ts":"1633057201.335600","files":[{"id":"F02GC5GGZQC","created":1633041295,"timestamp":1633041295,"name":"image.png","title":"image.png","mimetype":"image/png","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"png","pretty_type":"PNG","user":"U03C4RC8X","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":15666036,"url":"","url_download":"","url_private":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F02GC5GGZQC/image.p